{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34718","headline":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平入声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平入声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危檐仍空堦，十日滴不歇。\n青莎看成狂，白菊即欲没。\n吴王荒金尊，越妾挟玉瑟。\n当时虽愁霖，亦若惜落月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}